'''Ryu''' is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Street Fighter Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 8.10 Update#Update 8.10.5|Version 8.10.5]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Ryu
|image = E 480.png
|first appearance = [[Invincible Fist (Easy)]]
|money drop = 1,000¢ - 3,950¢
}}

==Enemy==
Ryu has average health and low damage output along with mediocre range but his [[Omni Strike]] lets him hit up to 600 range away from him, making snipers or slow units ineffective.

==Strategy==
The best way to deal with Ryu is using tanks like [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Jamiera Cat]] because they can take a lot of hits or high damage units [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] as they can kill him easily and take almost no damage.

